# Testing & Validation

## Project

**Virtual Agent–Driven SLA Breach Awareness & Justification System**

---

## Overview

The **Testing & Validation** phase verifies that every feature of the Virtual Agent–Driven SLA Breach Awareness & Justification System works as expected. Functional testing was performed to validate SLA creation, notifications, Virtual Agent interaction, UI policies, reports, and dashboard components.

This phase ensures the solution meets the project requirements and provides reliable SLA governance within the ServiceNow platform.

---

## Objectives

- Verify Incident creation and SLA attachment.
- Validate SLA lifecycle and At Risk detection.
- Test email notification workflow.
- Confirm UI Policy behavior.
- Verify Virtual Agent interactions.
- Validate SLA acknowledgement process.
- Test reporting functionality.
- Verify dashboard visualization.
- Ensure end-to-end SLA governance workflow.

---

