| Test Case 11 | Dashboard – SLA Governance View | ✅ Passed |

---

## Features Validated

### Incident Management

- Incident creation
- SLA attachment
- SLA timer execution

### SLA Governance

- SLA monitoring
- SLA At Risk detection
- Automatic work note updates

### Notifications

- Email notifications to assignees
- Email notifications to managers
- SLA warning messages

### UI Policies

- Mandatory SLA Breach Reason
- Mandatory SLA Breach Justification
- SLA Acknowledgement visibility

### Virtual Agent

- SLA awareness conversation
- Guided governance steps
- SLA acknowledgement confirmation

### Reporting

- SLA Breaches by Reason
- SLA Breaches by Assignment Group
- Pending Justifications
- Acknowledged vs Unacknowledged Breaches
- Top Assignees with SLA Violations
- SLA Performance Trend

### Dashboard

- Centralized SLA Governance Dashboard
- Real-time SLA monitoring
- Report widgets
- Performance visualization

---

## Expected Outcome

- Incidents are created successfully.
- SLA attaches automatically.
- SLA At Risk updates after threshold.
- Notification emails are delivered.
- UI Policy enforces mandatory fields.
- Virtual Agent guides users effectively.
- Reports display accurate SLA data.
- Dashboard provides centralized monitoring.

