## Conclusion

The **Testing & Validation** phase successfully verified all functional requirements of the **Virtual Agent–Driven SLA Breach Awareness & Justification System**. All eleven test cases passed successfully, confirming that the system accurately monitors SLAs, automates notifications, enforces governance policies, enables user interaction through the Virtual Agent, and provides comprehensive reporting and dashboard insights. The solution is stable, reliable, and ready for deployment in a ServiceNow environment.

